{
    "background_story": "Marlon was a brilliant scientist who had spent his entire career studying the mysteries of the atmosphere. His life's work was focused on developing a technology that could demist the fog-shrouded cities, bringing clarity and visibility to the millions of people who lived in them. Growing up in a city plagued by perpetual fog, Marlon had seen firsthand the dangers and difficulties it posed. His determination to find a solution drove him to experiment tirelessly, often for hours on end. Finally, after years of trial and error, Marlon succeeded in creating a device that could demist even the thickest of fogs. His invention revolutionized urban planning and transformed the lives of countless people, earning him international acclaim and recognition.",
